# The Finale — the lantern room. Not a board: a payoff (CANON 3.4).
# The victory lap is a chain of yeses, and every one of them is a character
# paying off their own arc.

scene f_lantern
  title "The Prismworks — the Lantern Room"
  bg lantern
  music MOOD_TOWER
  walk 140 464 1140 530
  spawn 200 534
  on_enter_cut f_iris_found
  on_enter f_iris_talk
  actor iris 700 524 sit
  hot 640 356 130 190 talk f_iris_ask "Iris Marlow"
  hot 400 334 140 130 look "The Prism, in its cradle, dark. Up close the crack is obvious. Up close it has been obvious for three years to exactly one person."
  hot 940 324 150 140 look "A camp bed made of rolled canvas, a jar of water, and a tally of days scratched into the sill. Seven of them. She has been rationing the water and not the tally."
  hot 200 204 120 160 talk f_rally "Ring the bell for the whole town" if flag f.iris_told
  feather 1020 204 f_fin1
  hot 1150 464 110 110 exit tower "Back down the stair"
